enresurser påverkar både nuvarande och framtida generationers möjligheter.", "en": "Access to clean drinking water and well-managed water systems is fundamental to public health and economic conditions. Water resource management affects both current and future generations' opportunities."}, "subtopics": ["vatten", "vattenförsörjning", "miljö", "infrastruktur", "resurs"], "parties_involved": ["MP"]}}